      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Webster%2C_New_York",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s history dates back to 1669, when the area that is now Webster was first discovered by European settlers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.websterny.org/146/History",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Webster’s own museum showcases permanent historical displays and rotating exhibits that highlight the town’s past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
