      ],
      "source": "https://www.websterny.org/146/History",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Webster’s waterfront borders Irondequoit Bay, an inlet of Lake Ontario that contains most of the town’s water area.",
